{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Bound repeated `BaseException` failures from `flush()`**\n\nIf an exporter raises a `BaseException` on every flush, `_flushes_completed` never advances. The parked drain repeatedly starts replacement workers, each of which fails identically, so the invocation never returns. Catch this failure per exporter and continue, or disable the scheduler and release waiters after an unrecoverable flush failure; add a persistently failing exporter test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wUq91","finding_digest":"7f80b0306fd7ca3520f20f5c47be227aeafd4343f7f9a36dc1d77904619d2e43","finding_id":"arf_v1_p6alamdp27fdkihsb5oepprcpl","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_run_loop::persistent-flush-baseexception-livelock","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_run_loop::persistent-flush-baseexception-livelock","line":325,"observation_digest":"278092b94d970cf1ca25135d8ef33dbad05213f148eed1022a6dd84019e00916","observation_id":"aro_v1_e6ajfokns4gpdsrfcnoy54z5xl","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T00:20:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_33ayiya5fwsl4v4tcidzfuh3ei","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"fb8af739a92f7fd8070d928029150fe4e5c9cc61","reviewer":"codex","start_line":325,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":734},"record_id":"art_v1_4dwg6mtapt6oemnygln2vmnbs5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T00:20:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
